SURFACE MAPPING OF THE BFACTOR PROPERTY
Step 1: computing a shell around the protein surface
Step 2: computing the property values and/or assign it to the shell particles
Step 3: computing the 2D sinusoidal projection coordinates of each shell particle
X_proj:  -16.342 -16.904 -17.939 -21.298 -21.545 -24.625 -23.316 -20.24 -23.459 -22.262 
Y_proj:  -10.266 -10.034 -12.329 -5.993 -5.48 -4.152 -1.35 -2.72 -0.636 1 
value:  0.09 0.09 0.02 0.09 0.09 0.06 0.06 0.09 0.06 0.06 
Step 4: dividing the 2D projection into 180x90 cells and smoothing the values
Step 5: computing the 2D map

